  "description": "The meaning of the pansy is “Please think of me.” The protagonist, “Pii,” is exhausted by everything. “Nodo” confesses his feelings to “Pii” every Thursday. “Pis,” a broken humanoid, keeps forgetting the lover he agreed to date yesterday. People with broken hearts and a human-like machine. This is a story about their slightly off-kilter love.\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
